# dev (minikube) component overlay.
#
# Deliberately empty of component flags. The local dev loop turns things on
# with `make <component>` / scripts/enable-component.sh, which writes the base
# ../../components.env -- keeping that as the single place a developer flips a
# flag. Anything set here would silently override it and be very confusing.
#
# Put dev-only *sizing* in values/<component>.yaml instead, not here.
